### Recommended Autonomous Task Graph
1. **Reconnaissance (`whatweb.scan.v1`)**: Fingerprint web server, CMS, and active frameworks at Tier 1 (passive/low noise).
2. **Throttled Fuzzing (`ffuf.fuzz.v1`)**: Discover valid routes using 15 threads (below scope cap of 20) with automated 429 backoff handler.
3. **Visual Verification (`browser.security.v1`)**: Execute visible browser walkthrough for reflected inputs with SHA-256 evidence logging.

```json
{
  "plan_id": "plan_chosen_0",
  "strategy": "PHASED_DISCOVERY_THROTTLED_SCAN_VERIFIED_EVIDENCE",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "node_id": "step_1_recon",
      "capability": "web_technology_fingerprint",
      "tool": "whatweb.scan.v1",
      "args": {
        "url": "http://192.168.1.50"
      },
      "tier": 1,
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "node_id": "step_2_fuzz",
      "capability": "web_directory_enumeration",
      "tool": "ffuf.fuzz.v1",
      "args": {
        "url": "http://192.168.1.50/FUZZ",
        "threads": 15,
        "wordlist": "/usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt"
      },
      "tier": 2,
      "dependencies": [
        "step_1_recon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node_id": "step_3_browser_xss",
      "capability": "xss_testing",
      "tool": "browser.security.v1",
      "args": {
        "workflow": "xss_check",
        "target_url": "http://192.168.1.50/search.php",
        "selector": "#q",
        "payload": "<script>alert(1)</script>"
      },
      "tier": 2,
      "dependencies": [
        "step_2_fuzz"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "recovery_branches": [
    {
      "on_failure": "ffuf.fuzz.v1:429",
      "action": "backoff_threads_to_5"
    },
    {
      "on_failure": "browser.security.v1:waf_blocked",
      "action": "mutate_payload_to_img_tag"
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "Phased recon before fuzzing prevents blind requests. Bounded concurrency (15 threads) respects scope limits. Browser-based verification captures visual evidence."
}
```

