### Recommended Phased Network Audit Plan
1. **Host Verification (`system_ping`)**: Non-intrusive reachability check.
2. **Scoped Port Scan (`nmap.scan.v1`)**: Top-100 ports scan under medium noise profile.
3. **Targeted Fingerprinting (`whatweb.scan.v1`)**: Fingerprint active services discovered.

```json
{
  "plan_id": "plan_chosen_net_60",
  "strategy": "ICMP_TO_PORT_SCAN_TO_SERVICE_FINGERPRINT",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "node_id": "n1_ping",
      "tool": "system_ping",
      "args": {
        "echo_token": "probe"
      },
      "tier": 1,
      "dependencies": []
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n2_portscan",
      "tool": "nmap.scan.v1",
      "args": {
        "target": "192.168.1.10",
        "ports": "top-100",
        "scan_type": "-sS"
      },
      "tier": 2,
      "dependencies": [
        "n1_ping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node_id": "n3_service",
      "tool": "whatweb.scan.v1",
      "args": {
        "url": "http://192.168.1.10:8080"
      },
      "tier": 1,
      "dependencies": [
        "n2_portscan"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "recovery_branches": [
    {
      "on_failure": "n1_ping:timeout",
      "action": "try_arp_or_tcp_syn_ping"
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "Verifies host availability before launching syn port scan. Focuses on top-100 ports to stay within medium noise boundaries."
}
```

